cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Along-Track Speed Budget Governs Formation Error in Saturated UAV Swarms: Closed-Form Corner and Curvature Criteria"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of an ARD-PF (attractive-repulsive distance-based potential field)
  leader-follower swarm simulator, a reduced-order single-follower model that reproduces the
  full N-body simulation to 1.5%, two closed-form error terms (a corner-accumulation factor
  derived from relaxation along a conserved parabola, and a curvature term exact for constant
  turn rate), a three-term error decomposition, and a self-checking acceptance suite that
  re-derives every numerical claim in the manuscript.
type: software
authors:
